  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Alur inti registrasi → aktif",
      "items": [
        "Signup (`src/lib/schemas.ts`, HP opsional) → user `type: merchant` → form profil (foto D1, `deliveryConfig`: radius+`feeByDistance` ATAU area+`feeByArea`)",
        "Submit → `tenantStatus: pending` → antrean SA (`f15:queue`, `tenant_submitted`) → approve/reject",
        "Deposit 3,50 JOD (§5C): bayar → SA verifikasi → `held` → `approved` → toko aktif; lalu kredit Founding 5 JOD (non-withdrawal, ≈33 order pertama) masuk — terpisah, bukan pengganti (I-2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Branch & guard",
      "items": [
        "Reject: `suspended` + alasan → daftar ulang (`/merchant/signup`)",
        "Deposit gagal/telat: reminder → suspend · blacklist: SA set `blacklisted` kapan pun → `f15-super-admin`",
        "Guard: rate limit signup, verifikasi deposit anti-fake (UNRESOLVED)",
        "Setelah aktif: onboarding kurir (karyawan merchant, rekrut off-app, maks 3) → `f13-courier-view`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Sumber & UNRESOLVED",
      "items": [
        "Dasar: PRD §5C (deposit 3,50 JOD) + §Insentif Founding (kredit 5 JOD, cashback 15/40/62,5 JOD) + I-1/I-2 + `C-12` · schema-draft entri 4 hanya nama field · front-end saja (AGENTS.md §1)",
        "UNRESOLVED: verifikasi deposit · I-3 cashback withdrawable · I-4 periode tier · I-5 kuota Founding · I-6 sisa modal",
        "UNRESOLVED: dokumen legal merchant · jadwal review SLA onboarding"
      ]
    }
